1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 5=

8
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:52,880
While that fool Zhao Dong is gone,

9
00:00:53,179 --> 00:00:54,340
let's all run away now.

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,020
No matter where we run,
it'll end the same.

11
00:00:58,939 --> 00:00:59,939
I'm not running.

12
00:01:00,479 --> 00:01:01,659
This is my fate.

13
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:05,219
The world is in chaos right now.

14
00:01:05,379 --> 00:01:06,780
Where could we even go?

15
00:01:07,299 --> 00:01:08,299
(No.)

16
00:01:08,299 --> 00:01:09,900
(Dong can only be mine.)

17
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:11,760
(I have to get rid of them.)

18
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:17,799
Actually, there's something

19
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:20,620
I've been struggling to tell you.

20
00:01:21,079 --> 00:01:22,120
Last night,

21
00:01:23,260 --> 00:01:24,620
the shameless Zhao Dong

22
00:01:25,819 --> 00:01:27,180
forced himself on me.

23
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:30,379
And...

24
00:01:30,739 --> 00:01:32,459
He's covered in sores,

25
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:34,040
reeking to high heaven.

26
00:01:35,340 --> 00:01:37,959
Why do I feel itchy all over?

27
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:41,459
I think he infected me!

28
00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:45,120
What am I going to do?

29
00:01:49,019 --> 00:01:51,799
(Why do I feel like she's acting?)

30
00:01:58,700 --> 00:02:00,700
My ladies, I'm back.

31
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,040
Dong!

32
00:02:03,799 --> 00:02:05,959
Miss Su, be careful.

33
00:02:05,959 --> 00:02:06,959
Stay away from him.

34
00:02:07,659 --> 00:02:08,659
Ladies,

35
00:02:09,979 --> 00:02:14,020
let me bear this suffering alone.

36
00:02:14,139 --> 00:02:15,219
As long as you're safe,

37
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:16,979
I'll be at ease.

38
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:20,919
Dong!

39
00:02:22,340 --> 00:02:25,060
Dong, you're back. Let's go.

40
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:28,659
(Su Wan'er lied. What's her game?)

41
00:02:32,699 --> 00:02:34,744
(Affection -100)

42
00:02:35,441 --> 00:02:36,594
(Affection -100)

43
00:02:37,607 --> 00:02:38,773
(Affection -100)

44
00:02:38,939 --> 00:02:39,939
(What's going on?)

45
00:02:40,580 --> 00:02:42,259
(Their affections all hit rock bottom.)

46
00:02:42,719 --> 00:02:43,740
(How to dual cultivate?)

47
00:02:45,139 --> 00:02:47,020
I came into some money last night.

48
00:02:47,740 --> 00:02:49,099
I bought you some fine wine, food,

49
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,400
and new clothes.

50
00:02:59,219 --> 00:03:00,219
What are you waiting for?

51
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,400
Sit down and eat.

52
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,219
After you eat, try on the new clothes.

53
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,560
Dong,

54
00:03:05,020 --> 00:03:06,099
they're not really hungry.

55
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,539
Don't force them.

56
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:10,840
Zhao Dong, you are unbelievably foolish.

57
00:03:11,479 --> 00:03:14,120
This windfall could have bought
over 30 jin of grain.

58
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,740
Instead, you wasted it.

59
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,620
New month in a few days.

60
00:03:18,020 --> 00:03:19,099
Fail to deliver the grain,

61
00:03:19,259 --> 00:03:20,560
and we're all going to suffer.

62
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:24,120
Exactly.
Since you're the head of this family,

63
00:03:24,259 --> 00:03:25,620
you should think about everyone.

64
00:03:29,319 --> 00:03:31,500
When the officials come,
what will you give them?

65
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,580
If we end up in jail for this,

66
00:03:33,780 --> 00:03:34,860
we'll be done for good.

67
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,800
A moment of pleasure,

68
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,800
ruin beyond redemption.

69
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:41,139
You... You've truly disappointed me.

70
00:03:43,020 --> 00:03:45,620
The revenue officer at the county office
is gravely ill.

71
00:03:45,780 --> 00:03:47,979
No physician in the region can help him.

72
00:03:49,020 --> 00:03:51,219
I plan to step in and save his life

73
00:03:51,539 --> 00:03:52,759
in exchange for supplies.

74
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,620
You don't know your place.

75
00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:57,479
How dare you provoke the authorities?

76
00:03:58,020 --> 00:04:00,699
Are you trying
to make things worse for us?

77
00:04:00,939 --> 00:04:03,939
Yeah. Everyone around here

78
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:06,599
knows exactly who you are.

79
00:04:07,139 --> 00:04:08,860
We can't do

80
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:10,919
such underhanded, crooked schemes.

81
00:04:11,139 --> 00:04:14,319
(You silly girls have no idea
what Dong's capable of.)

82
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:15,680
(The more you do this,)

83
00:04:15,900 --> 00:04:17,620
(the more he'll despise you.)

84
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,500
If I cure the revenue officer,

85
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:24,560
you'll all spend the night with me.

86
00:04:25,279 --> 00:04:27,500
What do you say? Do we have a bet?

87
00:04:33,300 --> 00:04:35,300
No, I'm not betting on that.

88
00:04:37,259 --> 00:04:38,259
If you win,

89
00:04:38,620 --> 00:04:40,740
I promise I won't touch you.

90
00:04:40,740 --> 00:04:41,740
I'll take that bet.

91
00:04:42,279 --> 00:04:43,720
If you fail to heal him,

92
00:04:44,139 --> 00:04:45,399
you absolutely cannot touch me.

93
00:04:45,639 --> 00:04:47,680
Fine. Sign it and seal it.

94
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:49,220
No backing out.

95
00:04:56,984 --> 00:04:58,439
(Zhang Mansion)

96
00:04:59,939 --> 00:05:03,480
Dong, this outfit you bought me
fits perfectly.

97
00:05:04,639 --> 00:05:06,980
Dong, they're holding a funeral here.

98
00:05:07,319 --> 00:05:09,180
Is the officer already dead?

99
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,040
(Great, he's definitely going to lose.)

100
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,600
We agreed

101
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:17,680
that if he is dead, you lose.

102
00:05:17,699 --> 00:05:18,699
And you can't touch me.

103
00:05:19,220 --> 00:05:21,420
It's in black and white,
sealed and signed.

104
00:05:21,620 --> 00:05:24,199
Hanyan, you're twisting the terms.

105
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,600
But, I'll allow it.

106
00:05:28,939 --> 00:05:31,860
Dong, so you can't touch her then.

107
00:05:34,439 --> 00:05:36,819
Dong, what do you know about medicine?

108
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,180
He is already dead.

109
00:05:38,399 --> 00:05:39,699
Just find a graceful way out.

110
00:05:41,639 --> 00:05:42,939
I said he won't die.

111
00:05:43,339 --> 00:05:44,699
Even Death wouldn't take him.

112
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:46,920
Let's go.

113
00:05:48,620 --> 00:05:50,899
(Oh, no. He's completely insane.)

114
00:05:51,259 --> 00:05:53,300
(If he causes trouble,
the whole family will pay.)

115
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:56,519
(Oh, my! Why did I have to end up
with a man like this?)

116
00:05:56,519 --> 00:05:58,363
(Affection -101)

117
00:06:01,980 --> 00:06:02,980
Zhao Laizi,

118
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,360
come here begging?

119
00:06:05,060 --> 00:06:06,720
You're dressed all fancy today.

120
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:09,279
Where did you steal those clothes?

121
00:06:10,180 --> 00:06:11,319
Watch your filthy mouth.

122
00:06:11,500 --> 00:06:14,600
Dong, he insulted you. I...

123
00:06:23,660 --> 00:06:27,079
Not only did your two wives
not starve to death,

124
00:06:27,420 --> 00:06:29,540
they're looking even more radiant.

125
00:06:31,399 --> 00:06:33,339
You got a real bargain.

126
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,879
(How dare you mock Dong?)

127
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:38,699
(You're asking for it.)

128
00:06:39,339 --> 00:06:40,620
This family is really something.

129
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:45,139
How can they allow stray dogs to bark
in the mourning hall?

130
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:47,139
You lowly fool!

131
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:48,720
What makes you think you belong here?

132
00:06:48,860 --> 00:06:49,860
Get out, now!

133
00:06:50,579 --> 00:06:51,819
Let's just go.

134
00:06:52,100 --> 00:06:53,240
Don't cause trouble.

135
00:06:53,620 --> 00:06:55,319
Are you trying to get us all killed?

136
00:06:56,819 --> 00:06:58,620
I'm here to treat Master Zhang.

137
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,120
Don't worry.

138
00:07:01,860 --> 00:07:05,680
A country bumpkin like you
dares to spout nonsense here?

139
00:07:06,319 --> 00:07:08,839
Master Zhang has passed away.

140
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,680
Are you here to summon his spirit?

141
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:12,379
You're just asking for death!

142
00:07:13,839 --> 00:07:15,379
I'll just ignore you ignorant fools.

143
00:07:15,660 --> 00:07:16,660
Wan'er,

144
00:07:16,660 --> 00:07:17,660
Hanyan,

145
00:07:17,939 --> 00:07:20,459
follow me inside to save a life.

146
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:24,079
You're putting on an act with me?

147
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:27,660
Someone! Break this fool's legs!

148
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,680
And drag these two lowborn women

149
00:07:31,379 --> 00:07:32,379
to the back room.

150
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,639
I'll interrogate them slowly later.

151
00:07:36,899 --> 00:07:37,899
Get them!

152
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:46,079
How did you end up on the ground?

153
00:07:46,860 --> 00:07:49,879
Looks like all those wild nights
have ruined your body.

154
00:07:50,759 --> 00:07:51,759
You're asking for it!

155
00:07:51,759 --> 00:07:52,759
Stop!

156
00:07:55,660 --> 00:07:58,720
My Lord, Zhao Dong has come
to stir up trouble.

157
00:07:59,279 --> 00:08:01,480
He even falsely claims
he can revive Master Zhang.

158
00:08:01,959 --> 00:08:03,839
But Master Zhang
has already passed away.

159
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:07,079
He's clearly insulting the Zhang family!

160
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:08,740
He deserves death.

161
00:08:09,100 --> 00:08:10,100
Darn it!

162
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,180
Master Zhang's time hasn't come yet.

163
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,339
Today is the day he rises from the dead.

164
00:08:14,879 --> 00:08:15,899
If I fail to revive him,

165
00:08:17,319 --> 00:08:18,699
I'll accept any punishment.

166
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:22,860
(This fool is really
going all the way with this.)

167
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,699
(Heaven is dooming my Liu family.)

168
00:08:25,699 --> 00:08:28,100
(Can Dong really bring the dead
back to life?)

169
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,240
(Stuck in a terrible position now,)

170
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,940
(I just hope Dong doesn't let me down.)

171
00:08:36,340 --> 00:08:39,539
My Lord,
since Zhao Dong is so confident,

172
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:41,320
why not let him give it a try?

173
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,480
On the off chance

174
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:45,600
a miracle actually happens.

175
00:08:56,059 --> 00:08:58,100
Today is the day of Yisi.

176
00:08:58,580 --> 00:09:00,059
Si Fire clashes with Hai Water.

177
00:09:00,500 --> 00:09:01,856
Master Zhang's fate is of water.

178
00:09:02,259 --> 00:09:03,720
Excessive fire rushed to the heart,

179
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:04,980
sealing off his breath.

180
00:09:05,419 --> 00:09:06,720
There's still a thread of life,

181
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:08,000
three cun

182
00:09:08,159 --> 00:09:10,240
beneath Zigong and Yutang acupoints,

183
00:09:10,460 --> 00:09:11,679
sealed there.

184
00:09:15,299 --> 00:09:16,299
Fine.

185
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:18,700
Since you speak with such conviction,

186
00:09:19,059 --> 00:09:20,320
I'll let you try.

187
00:09:20,879 --> 00:09:23,000
But if you fail to revive my father,

188
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:26,000
I will make sure the four of you

189
00:09:26,500 --> 00:09:27,679
beg for death

190
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:29,100
and be denied it.

191
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:36,320
Wan'er, we're finished.

192
00:09:36,580 --> 00:09:38,279
I told you we couldn't trust him.

193
00:09:38,519 --> 00:09:40,879
Don't be afraid.
We have to believe in Dong.

194
00:09:42,419 --> 00:09:44,120
It's okay. Let's go.

195
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,120
Go.

196
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,440
Zhao Laizi,

197
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:52,059
you're digging your own grave,

198
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:54,059
and dragging two pretty ladies
into this.

199
00:09:57,519 --> 00:09:58,879
Call the boys back.

200
00:09:59,279 --> 00:10:00,279
Yes, sir.

201
00:10:20,254 --> 00:10:23,845
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

202
00:10:23,845 --> 00:10:26,632
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

203
00:10:27,208 --> 00:10:29,370
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

204
00:10:29,370 --> 00:10:32,216
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

205
00:10:32,216 --> 00:10:35,494
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

206
00:10:35,494 --> 00:10:37,128
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

207
00:10:37,128 --> 00:10:39,192
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

208
00:10:39,192 --> 00:10:40,728
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

209
00:10:40,728 --> 00:10:43,510
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

210
00:10:43,959 --> 00:10:45,864
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

211
00:10:45,864 --> 00:10:51,895
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

212
00:10:52,477 --> 00:10:56,360
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

213
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:59,585
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

214
00:11:00,097 --> 00:11:02,696
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

215
00:11:02,696 --> 00:11:07,824
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

216
00:11:07,824 --> 00:11:11,352
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

217
00:11:11,352 --> 00:11:15,060
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

218
00:11:15,060 --> 00:11:16,952
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

219
00:11:16,952 --> 00:11:19,029
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

220
00:11:19,029 --> 00:11:21,560
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

221
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:25,597
♪You met the most precious person♪

222
00:11:27,265 --> 00:11:29,128
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

223
00:11:29,128 --> 00:11:31,647
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

224
00:11:31,647 --> 00:11:33,096
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

225
00:11:33,096 --> 00:11:35,398
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

226
00:11:35,398 --> 00:11:37,368
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

227
00:11:37,368 --> 00:11:41,778
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

228
00:11:41,778 --> 00:11:43,320
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

229
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:45,230
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

230
00:11:45,230 --> 00:11:48,504
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

231
00:11:48,504 --> 00:11:51,825
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

232
00:11:51,825 --> 00:11:53,560
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

233
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:58,184
♪Just catch your breath first♪

234
00:11:58,184 --> 00:12:01,934
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

235
00:12:01,934 --> 00:12:05,312
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

236
00:12:05,686 --> 00:12:07,656
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

237
00:12:07,656 --> 00:12:13,403
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

238
00:12:13,403 --> 00:12:16,919
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

239
00:12:16,919 --> 00:12:18,488
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

240
00:12:18,488 --> 00:12:20,798
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

241
00:12:20,798 --> 00:12:22,536
♪From laughter to devotion♪

242
00:12:22,536 --> 00:12:24,592
♪From falling to innocence♪

243
00:12:24,592 --> 00:12:26,440
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

244
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:33,110
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
